    {
      "id": "2072193823158256079",
      "text": "Apple actually approved my macOS app instantly, and it's fully live on the App Store right now. The twist? Google Play requires a strict, mandatory 14-day closed testing phase with active users before letting it go to public production. I need a dedicated group of Android power users to help clear the clock and test the local sync. DM your email to join the beta! 🍏🤖",
      "author": {
        "id": "1650859481784545280",
        "name": "Astrolabs",
        "screenName": "astrolabs21",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1970051136389603328/GzDU_N5a_normal.jpg",
        "verified": true
      },
      "metrics": {
        "likes": 2,
        "retweets": 0,
        "replies": 1,
        "quotes": 0,
