    {
      "id": "2072193654647910673",
      "text": "AirDrop completely ignores Android, leaving you stuck emailing yourself files or dealing with slow cloud sync. I built Vianta Connect as a native, secure local bridge for instant wireless file drops and shared clipboard sync. \nThe macOS app is officially live on the App Store! The Android companion is currently grinding through Google's mandatory 14-day closed testing phase. DM your email to get early access today. 🚀",
      "author": {
        "id": "1650859481784545280",
        "name": "Astrolabs",
        "screenName": "astrolabs21",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1970051136389603328/GzDU_N5a_normal.jpg",
